Cell["\<\
subprocess 1 :  \[Gamma](1) -> qp(6) + \[LineSeparator]                       \
                   qbp(1z) q (2) -> nu (3) + l (4)  + g (5)
subprocess 2 : \[Gamma](1) -> l(4) +
                                            lb(1z) q (2) -> nu (3) + g(5) + q\
\[CloseCurlyQuote](6)\
\>", "Text",
